      "end": 11775,
      "sourceText": "عَلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ يَتَوَكَّلُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-u-29-25-8",
      "text": "شما برخی دیگر را انکار می کنند، و",
      "logicalText": "يكفر بعضكم ببعض",
      "textHash": "a692a2e9372fcaf8b1f641312f4d0d7551bfe76958c68666178a233b8e017da7",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(4) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
