        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "betaEditorialReason": "The whole qualified prohibition prescribes a good manner of dialogue; retain its exception rather than mark the verb alone.",
      "start": 9174,
      "end": 9245,
      "sourceText": "لَا تُجَادِلُوا أَهْلَ الْكِتَابِ إِلَّا بِالَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ"
    },
