      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(5) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
